{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["A Mystic Tree is a ",["l","树","tree"]," that grows from a ",["l","神秘树种","Mystic Tree Seed"],". The ",["l","打造","crafting"]," recipe for the seed becomes available after ",["l","精通山洞","Foraging Mastery"]," is claimed. The tree yields ",["l","神秘糖浆","Mystic Syrup"]," every 7 days when ",["l","树液采集器","tapped"]," (3 days with a ",["l","重型树液采集器","Heavy Tapper"],"). It can be chopped down with an ",["l","斧头","axe"],", producing 7-11 ",["l","硬木","Hardwood"],", plus 1 Hardwood from the stump."]],["p",["By default, Mystic Trees have a 15% chance to grow to the next stage each night during ",["l","春季","Spring"],", ",["l","夏季","Summer"],", or ",["l","秋季","Fall"],". With ",["l","树肥","Tree Fertilizer"],", Mystic Trees have a 30% chance to grow to the next stage each night, including during ",["l","冬季","Winter"],". This means that unfertilized mystic trees usually grow in 26±12 days, while fertilized ones usually grow in 13±5 days."]],["p",["Unlike other trees, Mystic Trees do not spread seeds on their own. Their seeds also do not drop when shaken or chopped. The tree will interact with ",["l","蘑菇树桩","Mushroom Log"],"s to make more ",["l","紫蘑菇","Purple Mushroom"],"s available for harvest."]]]],["Stages of Growth",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Stage 1"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 2"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 3"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 4"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 5"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stump"]}],[[["f","Mystic_Tree_Stage_1.png",19]],[["f","Mystic_Tree_Stage_2.png",19]],[["f","Mystic_Tree_Stage_3.png",19]],[["f","Mystic_Tree_Stage_4.png",22]],[["f","Mystic_Tree_Stage_5.png",48]],[["f","Mystic_Tree_Stump.png",22]]]]]]]],"f":[["Seed",[["i","(O)MysticTreeSeed","Mystic Tree Seed"]]],["Tapper Product",[["i","(O)MysticSyrup","Mystic Syrup"]]],["Growth Time",["Variable"]]]}